--- !u!114 &2003529027
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2003529018}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6d8e833468e94ca478236b641bd7870f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  firstTimeDialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: ???
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Well\u2026 how curious. Fancy meeting someone all the way down here."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Huh?! Who are you?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Me? I\u2019m Sherma. Just another soul bound to this place."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "\u2026\nI didn\u2019t expect to find anyone alive. I thought Hell was
        a desolate pit\u2014nothing but suffering and silence."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Most believe that. But Hell is not empty\u2014it is awake. And it\u2019s
        been watching you since the moment you fell."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "Watching\u2026 me?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Yes. I can feel it clearly now. The Lord\u2019s power flows within you\u2014yet
        you seem completely unaware of it."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "The Lord\u2019s power? What are you talking about?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Your father. His essence still resonates within these chambers. Hell
        recognizes it\u2026 responds to it. You are, in a way, speaking the same
        language as this place."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "That doesn\u2019t make any sense."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: It will. It means you can harvest the powers of Hell itself.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "\u2026?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "At the end of certain chambers\u2014once you survive what lies within\u2014you\u2019ll
        feel it. A connection. Hell will offer you fragments of its strength."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "And I can just\u2026 take them?"
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: So I have to choose.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Exactly. Power here is not about greed\u2014it\u2019s about restraint."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: And why would I even need these powers?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "You wish to leave, don\u2019t you?"
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "I do. I\u2019ll escape\u2026 and I\u2019ll slay the wench who cast me
        into this place."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Then you\u2019ll need them.\nThis realm is crawling with creatures meant
        to ensure no one ever escapes. Every soul before you failed. Some fought.
        Some begged. None made it out."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "But you said I\u2019m different."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "You are. Hell does not merely trap you\u2014it tests you."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "\u2026I understand."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "One more thing, before you go.\nAs you travel, you\u2019ll find gems
        scattered throughout the floors."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Gems?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Remnants of humans who fell here carrying them. Hell collects what they
        leave behind. When you connect with a chamber\u2019s core, those gems will
        answer to you."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: And what are they used for?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "If you ever see me again, bring them. You may exchange them for\u2026
        advantages. Knowledge. Tools. Perhaps even power\u2014of a different kind."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: You speak as if you belong here.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: I do. I was born from the roots of Hell itself.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "\u2026Right."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: And what are they used for?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Don\u2019t dwell on it. Now go. Survive the chambers. Choose your powers
        wisely. And remember\u2014Hell rewards strength, but it devours the reckless."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "Thank you\u2026 Sherma."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "May the Goddess of Luck walk beside you. You\u2019ll need her more than
        you think."
  repeat: "Hell has rewarded you\u2026 Will you claim what it offers through me?"
